+<span style="font-weight: bold;"> SECTION 40-57-50.</span> Election of officers; seal; rules and procedures.<br /><br />
+	The commission annually shall elect from its total membership a chair, vice chair, and other officers the commission determines necessary at the first meeting in the fiscal year of the State. The commission may adopt an official seal and shall adopt rules and procedures reasonably necessary for the performance of its duties and the governance of its operations and proceedings.<br /><br />
